    20	/- KORE symbol: Lbl'UndsLSqBUnds-LT-'-undef'RSqB'; frozen source obligations: rule-75f08df4443da8a48ee02cff10c65980b5cd03f6f6f15985f63ba60ad2f96854. Replace this stub with its honest total meaning from the frozen K semantics. -/
